    <briefdescription>
<para>Demo 2D <ref refid="classScene" kindref="compound">Scene</ref> with a dynamic camera that follows the player. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This scene features a camera that follows the player entity, making it suitable for larger levels where the player can move beyond the screen. It includes platform collision and player movement mechanics.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This scene does not include enemies (unlike <ref refid="classDemo2DFixedScene" kindref="compound">Demo2DFixedScene</ref>). </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classDemo2DFixedScene" kindref="compound">Demo2DFixedScene</ref>, <ref refid="classPlayerController" kindref="compound">PlayerController</ref>, <ref refid="classCameraController" kindref="compound">CameraController</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
